          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "fa998562-de68-4a12-9703-1018afe90fe7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Ready to deliver polished, sleek looks for any occasion. Perfect not only for taming flyaways but also for achieving the trendy bushy-yet-groomed brow look. Its compact size makes it convenient to carry, keeping your style fresh wherever you go. The all-day hold formula leaves no oily, greasy, or crusty residue while nourishing your hair with hydrating ingredients, including jojoba and biotin.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
