            "image_link": "",
            "small_caption": "",
            "accent": "",
            "heading": "3. straighten",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-4-base",
            "text": "<p>Straighten your dry hair to seal in the treatment, and that's it. Smooth, sleek, and oh-so chic. Enjoy your new head-turning masterpiece.</p>",
